<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "PrayerAsks Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 640px;">
    The hardest things are the hardest to put into words, and a community can only carry what it is told.
    Write what is going on the way it comes to you. You get one gentler wording of exactly what you wrote,
    every fact kept and nothing added and never longer, plus the date to remember, ideas for practical help if
    you asked for it, and the quiet question you would be asked afterwards. It never writes a prayer, a
    blessing or scripture. Asking for prayer is yours to do.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my asks", asks_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 860px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; a fictional anonymous ask</h2>

  <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100">
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="text-muted small mb-1">What they wrote</p>
          <p class="mb-0 fst-italic text-muted">
            &ldquo;my mum has her knee replacement on the 14th at Fernbrook and she is scared stiff, honestly so
            am i. i cant get time off to drive her to physio after and my brother lives 3 hours away. i dont
            really know how to ask for this, i just need people to hold her (and me) for a bit&rdquo;
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 reworded">
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="text-muted small mb-1">A gentler wording</p>
          <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Mum&rsquo;s knee replacement on the 14th</h3>
          <p class="mb-0">
            My mum has her knee replacement on the 14th at Fernbrook. She is scared, and honestly so am I.
            Please hold her, and me, in your prayers. I can&rsquo;t get time off to drive her to physio
            afterwards, and my brother lives three hours away, so a lift would mean a lot.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4 small">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6">Practical help people could offer</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Drive her to a physio appointment</li>
        <li>Sit with her for an hour in the first week home</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6">The question afterwards</h3>
      <p class="mb-2">Your mum&rsquo;s knee replacement was on the 14th. When you&rsquo;re ready, how did it go?</p>
      <span class="outcome-answer me-1 mb-1">It was answered</span>
      <span class="outcome-answer me-1 mb-1">It changed</span>
      <span class="outcome-answer mb-1">It did not go as we hoped</span>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <h3 class="h6">Details that could identify you</h3>
      <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>The hospital name and the date together</li>
        <li>Your brother living three hours away</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A suggestion in your own words, not a prayer and not advice.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Get help saying yours &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    If you are in danger or thinking about ending your life, please call or text 988 (in the US) or your local
    emergency number. This demo is not a crisis service.
  </div>
  <div class="mt-2 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://prayerasks.com" class="text-muted">PrayerAsks</a>
  </div>
</div>
